[8.66,"o","The user chooses how unstale reads new release notes. Show them these options as printed and ask.\r\n"]
[8.72,"o","Never choose for them.\r\n"]
[8.78,"o","\r\n"]
[8.84,"o","     Read with                 Cost a year, this repo   Compared with the best option\r\n"]
[8.9,"o","  1  Jev + Vercel AI Gateway   ≈ $0.083                 the best option\r\n"]
[8.96,"o","  2  Vercel AI Gateway         ≈ $0.16                  ≈ 93% of its breaking-change flags\r\n"]
[9.02,"o","  3  Anthropic                 ≈ $0.23                  ≈ 90% of its changes\r\n"]
[9.08,"o","  4  Not now                   free                     ≈ 27%: advisories and deprecations only\r\n"]
[9.14,"o","     Jev: a labelling service, used beside the provider that reads the notes.\r\n"]
[9.2,"o","     Keys: JEV_API_KEY, AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY, ANTHROPIC_API_KEY\r\n"]
[9.26,"o","\r\n"]
[9.32,"o","Record their answer with the matching command:\r\n"]
[9.38,"o","  1  unstale setup --inference jev+env:AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY\r\n"]
